#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Awakening Psion"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Awakening Psion" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You survived a portal storm and hid inside while reality broke around you, "
"and when you left to examine the damage you found a strange crystal the storm"
" had left behind.  It was captivating, and you took it with you.  Sometimes, "
"at night, you look into it before you sleep, and you almost feel like "
"something in you is responding to the glow within the crystal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
