#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Cuāuhpilli Special Forces"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Cuāuhpilli Special Forces" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on guard duty when the ship was preparing to enter Tliltilhuicaātl "
"and had just braced for the jump when something went wrong.  The ship seemed "
"like it was turning inside out, then you seemed like you were turning inside "
"out, and suddenly you were planetside in the ruins of a dying world.  You've "
"served the Excān Tlahtōlōyān on a dozen worlds, taken five captives, and even"
" have clearance for contact with huecachane civilizations, but none of that "
"has prepared you for the Cataclysm"
msgstr ""

