"You draw the plus symbol card, look at it for a moment, and put it back in "
"the deck."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_FORCE_FIELD_GENERATOR_ACTIVATION_2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_FORCE_FIELD_GENERATOR_ACTIVATION"
