"The device makes a whining sound and there is a sharp smell of burnt plastic!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_FORCE_FIELD_GENERATOR_ACTIVATION"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_items.json
msgid "Without a matrix crystal to power it, flipping the toggle does nothing."
