#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/powers.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
msgid ""
"There is a long moment of darkness and terrible cold that seems like it will "
"freeze your heart, and then you are somewhere else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PSI_TRANSPORTER_REMOTE_TELEPORT_TRANSPORT_NO"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_items.json
msgid ""
"Instead of confirming the destination, you press the button and turn the "
"transporter remote off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PSI_USB_RAD_RECIPE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_learn_recipes.json
msgid ""
"You plug in the USB and find a series of powerpoint presentations, long "
"technical-looking documents, video files, and other documents.  It's going to"
" take a long while to sort through these."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_PSI_USB_RAD_RECIPE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_learn_recipes.json
msgid "Without a laptop, you can't access the data on the USB"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PSI_RESEARCH_LEARN_EXTENDED_CHANNELING_TRIGGER"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_learn_recipes.json
msgid ""
"The state of mind necessary to channel while maintaining other powers has you"
" thinking.  It requires fine control to maintain your concentration on "
"multiple things at once, but what if you applied that level of control to a "
"single power at a time?  If you slowly and carefully drew on just as much "
"energy as you needed, maybe there would be fewer side effects?  With some "
"experimentation, perhaps you can discover a way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PSI_RESEARCH_LEARN_TORRENTIAL_CHANNELING_TRIGGER"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_learn_recipes.json
msgid ""
"Safety is all well and good, but sometimes you need power.  The ebb and flow "
"of Nether energy…if you deliberately drew on it more deeply, could you charge"
" your powers up more quickly?  Maybe you can figure out a way with some more "
"experimentation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_MESSAGE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You begin rewiring your brain to change your way of looking at the world."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SUCCESS_MESSAGE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "You now see the world in an entirely different way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SIDE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "You suddenly feel much less empathetic towards others."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SIDE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You've realized that you're far more empathetic to others.  Even those who "
"may not deserve it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SIDE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"There's no way you could possibly even contemplate even moving an inch into "
"the darkness because that's so so so so so so so incredibly uncomfortably "
"terrifyingly horrible.  Please no."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SIDE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"It's so much easier to recognize how you are just that much more attractive "
"than everyone else.  You need to make sure they know it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SIDE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"That stuff you used to eat is completely disgusting.  Going hungry is nowhere"
" near as painful as having to suffer even the slightest taste of that slop!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SIDE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "You feel an enormous need to interact with others!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SIDE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "You feel an incredible need to avoid others!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SIDE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Guns are just too scary.  The loud bang, the thought of them being used on "
"you… despite their utility, there's no way you could get close to one of "
"them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SIDE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"There's so much that could go wrong if you ever got behind a wheel.  Cars "
"used to be one of the largest causes of death before the Cataclysm, and "
"there's definitely no need to decrease your odds by getting in one now!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SIDE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Keep moving keep moving keep moving keep moving keep moving keep moving!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SIDE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"The blood and cuts that come alongside combat is bad enough.  Putting such "
"disgusting clothes on your skin is absolutely not an option."
msgstr ""
